  "details": "Every time I try to register a world into my favorites, sorted into any of the three playlists available, the world description interface will show that it has been successfully added.\n\nHowever, upon opening the playlists to access these worlds, they not be appearing in any of them. The number is currently stuck at 14. It also does not let me remove any I've saved in my lists.\n\nI have tried reinstalling, relogging, and reopening the game in both VR and Desktop mode, but it did not help.\n\nTried to change the settings of the lists from private to public, it did not sort any effect either.\n\nI could provide the output logs if needed, but it seems like I have no way to do so through this form.",
